{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Naughty Chat is a text-based chat simulator in which you help a girl named Amelia with her master's thesis. Luckily for her, you are just the right person to help her...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3580330/extras/GIF2.gif?t=1752894103\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\ud83d\udcbb EARINING MONEY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You are a graduate student who earns money by helping other students with their homework. Even though you are not an expert in every subject, you help everyone with any task by using AI assistants.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3580330/extras/GIF3.gif?t=1752894103\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\u2764\ufe0f\u200d\ud83d\udd25\ufe0fAMELIA</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Amelia, a rich girl you\u2019ve met a party, is your new client - she needs help with her master's thesis. The assignment is much harder than what you usually do, you've never done anyone's thesis before, but she offers you a large sum of money for your help.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">After some consideration, you decide to help her.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3580330/extras/GIF1.gif?t=1752894103\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\ud83d\udd00 WHAT WILL YOU DO?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choosing different options in the dialog will give you different results, be sure to try them all!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3580330/extras/GIF5.gif?t=1752894103\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\ud83d\udd1eNAUGHTY STUFF</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As you progress through the story, you'll slowly win Amelia\u2019s favor and receive naughty pictures from her. Once she sends you a picture, you unlock it in the gallery, which you can access at any time during the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3580330/extras/GIF4.gif?t=1752894103\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Naughty Chat will give you:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">-\u00a0About 2 hours of gameplay \ud83d\udd50 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- 50+ unique high quality renders\u2b50\ufe0f</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Choices that decide what special content you get \ud83d\udd00</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Flirt with Amelia who will respond to your requests \ud83d\ude08</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3580330?t=1752894103","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3580330?t=1752894103","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3580330/ed10045c68c051fa7ab32f8f90dee4af59afd6b0/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1752894103","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3580330/ed10045c68c051fa7ab32f8f90dee4af59afd6b0/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1752894103","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[1,3,4,5],"notes":"This game may contain content not appropriate for all ages, or may not be appropriate for viewing at work: sexting, nudity or sexual content, general mature content, sexual acts.\r\n\r\nAll characters involved in sexual content are over the age of 18."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Naughty Chat is a text-based chat simulator in which you help a girl named Amelia with her master's thesis. Luckily for her, you are just the right person to help her...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3580330/extras/GIF2.gif?t=1752894103\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\ud83d\udcbb EARINING MONEY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You are a graduate student who earns money by helping other students with their homework. Even though you are not an expert in every subject, you help everyone with any task by using AI assistants.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3580330/extras/GIF3.gif?t=1752894103\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\u2764\ufe0f\u200d\ud83d\udd25\ufe0fAMELIA</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Amelia, a rich girl you\u2019ve met a party, is your new client - she needs help with her master's thesis. The assignment is much harder than what you usually do, you've never done anyone's thesis before, but she offers you a large sum of money for your help.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">After some consideration, you decide to help her.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3580330/extras/GIF1.gif?t=1752894103\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\ud83d\udd00 WHAT WILL YOU DO?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choosing different options in the dialog will give you different results, be sure to try them all!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3580330/extras/GIF5.gif?t=1752894103\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\ud83d\udd1eNAUGHTY STUFF</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As you progress through the story, you'll slowly win Amelia\u2019s favor and receive naughty pictures from her. Once she sends you a picture, you unlock it in the gallery, which you can access at any time during the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3580330/extras/GIF4.gif?t=1752894103\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Naughty Chat will give you:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">-\u00a0About 2 hours of gameplay \ud83d\udd50 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- 50+ unique high quality renders\u2b50\ufe0f</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Choices that decide what special content you get \ud83d\udd00</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Flirt with Amelia who will respond to your requests \ud83d\ude08</p>","developers":["Love Seekers"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3580330/450ce287f616bc218d142165d09a187240cfd581/header.jpg?t=1752894103","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257143913,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257143913/movie480.mp4?t=1747960071","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257143913/movie_max.mp4?t=1747960071"},"name":"Naughty Chat Trailer","thumbnail":"h